harmfulness_direction.safetensors, refusal_direction.safetensors, high_stakes_probe.safetensors: built by us; MIT License, as
the rest of this repository. They were fit on public data that this repository does not include: the prompts of
andyrdt/refusal_direction (Apache-2.0 repository; according to Arditi et al., harmful prompts from AdvBench, MaliciousInstruct,
TDC2023 and HarmBench, harmless prompts from Alpaca) and the Hugging Face dataset Arrrlex/models-under-pressure (MIT License).
